# Planning, notes and AI-assistant instructions. These stay on disk but are never
# committed: they are working scaffolding, not part of the delivered project.
# NOTE: .gitignore only excludes UNTRACKED files. If one of these ever shows up in
# `git status` as tracked again, untrack it with `git rm --cached <file>` -- adding
# it here is not enough.
