# Uploaded files / scratch
*.pdf
*.md:
# ...but every figure in the report is a committed deliverable. House rule: each
# figure is a PDF written to reports/figures/ through src/figure_export.py, so a
# blanket *.pdf ignore deletes the figures from every fresh clone.
!reports/figures/*.pdf

